{"suttaId":"sn35.94","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iv","vriCode":"s0304m.mul","paras":[466,499],"vripara":"94"},"segments":{"sn35.94:0.3":"Adantaaguttasuttaṃ","sn35.94:1.1":"Sāvatthinidānaṃ.","sn35.94:1.2":"“Chayime, bhikkhave, phassāyatanā adantā aguttā arakkhitā asaṃvutā dukkhādhivāhā honti.","sn35.94:1.3":"Katame cha?","sn35.94:1.4":"Cakkhu, bhikkhave, phassāyatanaṃ adantaṃ aguttaṃ arakkhitaṃ asaṃvutaṃ dukkhādhivāhaṃ hoti … pe … jivhā, bhikkhave, phassāyatanaṃ adantaṃ aguttaṃ arakkhitaṃ asaṃvutaṃ dukkhādhivāhaṃ hoti … pe … mano, bhikkhave, phassāyatanaṃ adantaṃ aguttaṃ arakkhitaṃ asaṃvutaṃ dukkhādhivāhaṃ hoti.","sn35.94:1.7":"Ime kho, bhikkhave, cha phassāyatanā adantā aguttā arakkhitā asaṃvutā dukkhādhivāhā honti”.","sn35.94:2.1":"“Chayime, bhikkhave, phassāyatanā sudantā suguttā surakkhitā susaṃvutā sukhādhivāhā honti.","sn35.94:2.2":"Katame cha?","sn35.94:2.3":"Cakkhu, bhikkhave, phassāyatanaṃ sudantaṃ suguttaṃ surakkhitaṃ susaṃvutaṃ sukhādhivāhaṃ hoti … pe … jivhā, bhikkhave, phassāyatanaṃ sudantaṃ suguttaṃ surakkhitaṃ susaṃvutaṃ sukhādhivāhaṃ hoti … pe … mano, bhikkhave, phassāyatanaṃ sudantaṃ suguttaṃ surakkhitaṃ susaṃvutaṃ sukhādhivāhaṃ hoti.","sn35.94:2.6":"Ime kho, bhikkhave, cha phassāyatanā sudantā suguttā surakkhitā susaṃvutā sukhādhivāhā hontī”ti.","sn35.94:2.7":"Idamavoca bhagavā … pe … etadavoca satthā –","sn35.94:3.1":"“Saḷeva [chaḷeva (ka.)] phassāyatanāni bhikkhavo,","sn35.94:3.2":"Asaṃvuto yattha dukkhaṃ nigacchati;","sn35.94:3.3":"Tesañca ye saṃvaraṇaṃ avedisuṃ,","sn35.94:3.4":"Saddhādutiyā viharantānavassutā.","sn35.94:4.1":"“Disvāna rūpāni manoramāni,","sn35.94:4.2":"Athopi disvāna amanoramāni;","sn35.94:4.3":"Manorame rāgapathaṃ vinodaye,","sn35.94:4.4":"Na cāppiyaṃ meti manaṃ padosaye.","sn35.94:5.1":"“Saddañca sutvā dubhayaṃ piyāppiyaṃ,","sn35.94:5.2":"Piyamhi sadde na samucchito siyā;","sn35.94:5.3":"Athoppiye dosagataṃ vinodaye,","sn35.94:5.4":"Na cāppiyaṃ meti manaṃ padosaye.","sn35.94:6.1":"“Gandhañca ghatvā surabhiṃ manoramaṃ,","sn35.94:6.2":"Athopi ghatvā asuciṃ akantiyaṃ;","sn35.94:6.3":"Akantiyasmiṃ paṭighaṃ vinodaye,","sn35.94:6.4":"Chandānunīto na ca kantiye siyā.","sn35.94:7.1":"“Rasañca bhotvāna asāditañca sāduṃ,","sn35.94:7.2":"Athopi bhotvāna asādumekadā;","sn35.94:7.3":"Sāduṃ rasaṃ nājjhosāya bhuñje,","sn35.94:7.4":"Virodhamāsādusu nopadaṃsaye.","sn35.94:8.1":"“Phassena phuṭṭho na sukhena majje [majjhe (syā. kaṃ. pī.)],","sn35.94:8.2":"Dukkhena phuṭṭhopi na sampavedhe;","sn35.94:8.3":"Phassadvayaṃ sukhadukkhe upekkhe,","sn35.94:8.4":"Anānuruddho aviruddha kenaci.","sn35.94:9.1":"“Papañcasaññā itarītarā narā,","sn35.94:9.2":"Papañcayantā upayanti saññino;","sn35.94:9.3":"Manomayaṃ gehasitañca sabbaṃ,","sn35.94:9.4":"Panujja nekkhammasitaṃ irīyati.","sn35.94:10.1":"“Evaṃ mano chassu yadā subhāvito,","sn35.94:10.2":"Phuṭṭhassa cittaṃ na vikampate kvaci;","sn35.94:10.3":"Te rāgadose abhibhuyya bhikkhavo,","sn35.94:10.4":"Bhavattha [bhavatha (sī. syā. kaṃ.)] jātimaraṇassa pāragā”ti.","sn35.94:10.5":"paṭhamaṃ;"},"attha":{"book":"Spk-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0304a.att","from":153,"to":157,"paras":[{"para":153,"vripara":"94","refs":["sn35.94:1","sn35.94:2"],"lines":["Saḷavaggassa paṭhame <b>adantā</b>ti adamitā.","<b>Aguttā</b>ti agopitā.","<b>Arakkhitā</b>ti na rakkhitā.","<b>Asaṃvutā</b>ti apihitā.","<b>Dukkhādhivāhā hontī</b>ti nerayikādibhedaṃ adhikadukkhaṃ āvahanakā honti.","<b>Sukhādhivāhā hontī</b>ti jhānamaggaphalapabhedaṃ adhikasukhaṃ āvahanakā honti.","Adhivahātipi pāṭho, esevattho."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.94:1"],["sn35.94:1"],["sn35.94:1"],["sn35.94:1"],["sn35.94:1"],["sn35.94:2"],["sn35.94:2"]]},{"para":154,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.94:3"],"lines":["<b>Saḷevā</b>ti cha eva.","<b>Asaṃvuto yattha dukkhaṃ nigacchatī</b>ti yesu āyatanesu saṃvaravirahito dukkhaṃ pāpuṇāti.","<b>Tesañca ye saṃvaraṇaṃ avedisun</b>ti ye tesaṃ āyatanānaṃ saṃvaraṃ vindiṃsu paṭilabhiṃsu.","<b>Viharantānavassutā</b>ti viharanti anavassutā atintā."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.94:3"],["sn35.94:3"],["sn35.94:3"],["sn35.94:3"]]},{"para":155,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.94:7","sn35.94:8"],"lines":["<b>Asāditañca sādun</b>ti assādavantañca madhurañca.","<b>Phassadvayaṃ sukhadukkhe upekkhe</b>ti sukhaphassañca dukkhaphassañcāti idaṃ phassadvayaṃ upekkhe, upekkhāmevettha uppādeyyāti attho.","Phassadvayaṃ sukhadukkhaṃ upekkhoti vā pāṭho, phassahetukaṃ sukhadukkhaṃ upekkho, sukhe anurodhaṃ dukkhe ca virodhaṃ anuppādento upekkhako bhaveyyātipi attho.","<b>Anānuruddho aviruddho kenacī</b>ti kenaci saddhiṃ neva anuruddho na viruddho bhaveyya."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.94:7"],["sn35.94:8"],["sn35.94:8"],["sn35.94:8"]]},{"para":156,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.94:9"],"lines":["<b>Papañcasaññā</b>ti kilesasaññāya papañcasaññā nāma hutvā.","<b>Itarītarā narā</b>ti lāmakasattā <b>papañcayantā upayantī</b>ti papañcayamānā vaṭṭaṃ upagacchanti.","<b>Saññino</b>ti sasaññā sattā.","<b>Manomayaṃ gehasitañca sabban</b>ti sabbameva pañcakāmaguṇagehanissitaṃ manomayaṃ vitakkaṃ.","<b>Panujjā</b>ti panuditvā nīharitvā.","<b>Nekkhammasitaṃ irīyatī</b>ti dabbajātiko bhikkhu nekkhammasitaṃ iriyena irīyati."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.94:9"],["sn35.94:9"],["sn35.94:9"],["sn35.94:9"],["sn35.94:9"],["sn35.94:9"]]},{"para":157,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.94:10"],"lines":["<b>Chassu yadā subhāvito</b>ti chasu ārammaṇesu yadā suṭṭhu bhāvito.","<b>Phuṭṭhassa cittaṃ na vikampate kvacī</b>ti sukhaphassena vā dukkhaphassena vā phuṭṭhassa kismiñci cittaṃ na kampati na vedhati.","<b>Bhavattha jātimaraṇassa pāragā</b>ti jātimaraṇānaṃ pāraṃ nibbānaṃ gamakā hotha."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.94:10"],["sn35.94:10"],["sn35.94:10"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn35.94:1.2","adantā",0,0],["sn35.94:1.4","adantā",0,0],["sn35.94:1.7","adantā",0,0],["sn35.94:1.2","aguttā",0,1],["sn35.94:1.4","aguttā",0,1],["sn35.94:1.7","aguttā",0,1],["sn35.94:1.2","arakkhitā",0,2],["sn35.94:1.4","arakkhitā",0,2],["sn35.94:1.7","arakkhitā",0,2],["sn35.94:1.2","asaṃvutā",0,3],["sn35.94:1.4","asaṃvutā",0,3],["sn35.94:1.7","asaṃvutā",0,3],["sn35.94:1.2","dukkhādhivāhā hontī",0,4],["sn35.94:1.7","dukkhādhivāhā hontī",0,4],["sn35.94:2.1","sukhādhivāhā hontī",0,5],["sn35.94:2.6","sukhādhivāhā hontī",0,5],["sn35.94:3.1","saḷevā",1,0],["sn35.94:3.2","asaṃvuto yattha dukkhaṃ nigacchatī",1,1],["sn35.94:3.3","tesañca ye saṃvaraṇaṃ avedisuṃ",1,2],["sn35.94:3.4","viharantānavassutā",1,3],["sn35.94:7.1","asāditañca sāduṃ",2,0],["sn35.94:8.3","phassadvayaṃ sukhadukkhe upekkhe",2,1],["sn35.94:9.1","papañcasaññā",3,0],["sn35.94:9.1","itarītarā narā",3,1],["sn35.94:9.2","papañcayantā upayantī",3,1],["sn35.94:9.2","saññino",3,2],["sn35.94:9.3","manomayaṃ gehasitañca sabbaṃ",3,3],["sn35.94:9.4","panujjā",3,4],["sn35.94:9.4","nekkhammasitaṃ irīyatī",3,5],["sn35.94:10.1","chassu yadā subhāvito",4,0],["sn35.94:10.2","phuṭṭhassa cittaṃ na vikampate kvacī",4,1],["sn35.94:10.4","bhavattha jātimaraṇassa pāragā",4,2]]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0304t.tik","from":154,"to":158,"paras":[{"para":154,"vripara":"94","refs":["sn35.94:1","sn35.94:7"],"lines":["<b>Adamitā</b>ti damaṃ nibbisevanabhāvaṃ anītā.","<b>Agopitā</b>ti satisaṅkhātāya vatiyā na rakkhitā.","<b>Apihitā</b>ti satikavāṭena na pihitā.","Catūhipi padehi indriyānaṃ anāvaraṇamevāha.","Adhikaṃ vahantīti adhivāhā, dukkhassa adhivāhā <b>dukkhādhivāhā</b>.","Nirayesu uppajjanakaṃ <b>nerayikaṃ.</b>","<b>Ādi</b> -saddena sesapāḷiṃ saṅgaṇhāti."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.94:1"],["sn35.94:1"],["sn35.94:1"],["sn35.94:1"],["sn35.94:1"],["sn35.94:1"],["sn35.94:7"]]},{"para":155,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.94:3"],"lines":["<b>Saḷevā</b>ti cha-kārassa sa-kāro, ḷa-kāro padasandhikaro.","<b>Yatthā</b>ti nimittatthe bhummaṃ.","<b>Anavassutā atintā</b>ti rāgena atemitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.94:3"],["sn35.94:3"],["sn35.94:3"]]},{"para":156,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.94:8"],"lines":["<b>Assāditan</b>ti assādaṃ itaṃ upagataṃ.","Tenāha <b>“assādavantan”</b>ti.","<b>Sukhadukkhan</b>ti iṭṭhāniṭṭhaṃ.","Anvayatīti anvayo, hetu.","Phassoti anvayo etassāti <b>phassanvayan</b>ti āha –","<b>“phassahetukan”</b>ti.","<b>“Aviruddha”</b> iti vibhattilopena niddeso."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.94:8"],["sn35.94:8"],["sn35.94:8"],["sn35.94:8"],["sn35.94:8"],["sn35.94:8"],["sn35.94:8"]]},{"para":157,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.94:9"],"lines":["<b>Papañcasaññā</b>ti taṇhādisamadhūpasaṃhatasaññā.","Tenāha <b>“kilesasaññāya papañcasaññā nāma hutvā”</b>ti.","Papañcasaññā etesaṃ atthīti <b>papañcasaññā,</b> itarītarā narā.","<b>Papañcayantā</b>ti saṃsāre papañcaṃ cirāyanaṃ karontā.","<b>Saññino</b>ti gehassitasaññāya saññāvanto.","<b>Manomayaṃ vitakkan</b>ti kevalaṃ manasā sambhāvitaṃ micchāvitakkaṃ.","<b>Irīyatī</b>ti iriyaṃ paṭipattiṃ irīyati paṭipajjati."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.94:9"],["sn35.94:9"],["sn35.94:9"],["sn35.94:9"],["sn35.94:9"],["sn35.94:9"],["sn35.94:9"]]},{"para":158,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.94:10"],"lines":["<b>Suṭṭhu bhāvito</b>ti suṭṭhubhāvaṃ subhāvanaṃ ito bhāvitabhāvito.","<b>Phuṭṭhassa cittan</b>ti tena yathāvuttaphassena phuṭṭhaṃ assa cittaṃ.","<b>Na vikampate kvacī</b>ti kismiñci iṭṭhāniṭṭhārammaṇe na kampati.","<b>Pāragā</b>ti pāragāmino bhavatha."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.94:10"],["sn35.94:10"],["sn35.94:10"],["sn35.94:10"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn35.94:1.2","dukkhādhivāhā",0,4],["sn35.94:1.4","dukkhādhivāhā",0,4],["sn35.94:1.7","dukkhādhivāhā",0,4],["sn35.94:7.1","ādi",0,6],["sn35.94:3.1","saḷevā",1,0],["sn35.94:3.2","yatthā",1,1],["sn35.94:8.4","aviruddha",2,6],["sn35.94:9.1","papañcasaññā",3,0],["sn35.94:9.1","papañcasaññā",3,2],["sn35.94:9.2","papañcayantā",3,3],["sn35.94:9.2","saññino",3,4],["sn35.94:9.4","irīyatī",3,6],["sn35.94:10.2","phuṭṭhassa cittaṃ",4,1],["sn35.94:10.2","na vikampate kvacī",4,2],["sn35.94:10.4","pāragā",4,3]]}}
